@norvid-studies.bsky.social: just a very strange and surreal situation we find ourselves in. that I mostly don't notice but sometimes it creeps up on me
  [image, no alt text]
@nequals001.bsky.social: i remember you posting destiny's stream or something about a fake person, and talking about how your social media use still remained unchanged tho.

is it still unchanged?
