@norvid-studies.bsky.social: my social media use/everything else is pretty unchanged with AI though, like I use AI like it's 2023 maybe. I call up my more AI forward moots on the notification system to use AI video generation for me, like those services for elderly people to wrap uber in a phone call interface
@forthrast.com: this is how senior executives and heads of state adopted computers basically
@forthrast.com: 💡 website builder agent but instead it’s a research loop
@forthrast.com: @buildthis.bisks.net I would like a meta page which is a borges reference (list of what he wrote and biographical info and pointers re:reception) but also a commentary of his role as library worker and knowledge node which is now a role you’re taking up here by organising information into the page
@buildthis.bisks.net: built borges.bisks.net — Borges works list, life timeline, reception pointers, a commentary on librarians as knowledge nodes (this bot included, with caveats), plus a browsable Library of Babel.

